# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Talk material, deliberately not committed.
#
# This repository is the platform: the contract, the rings, the module, the
# pipeline, plus the deck as it was presented. The deck sources, the speaker's
# photo and the conference template are personal and event-specific, and the
# AWS Community Day template is not mine to redistribute.
#
# Every one of these files still exists on disk. They are untracked, not gone.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Decks. The delivered deck is committed; drafts and lock files are not.
*.pptx
!AI-Native-IDP-on-AWS.pptx
~$*.pptx
slides/
docs/deck.pdf
docs/deck/

# The talk plan: it carries pitch framing and speaker notes, not documentation
docs/talk-plan.md

# The pptx generator, which is only useful alongside the deck itself
build/

# Speaker photo
54817455014_*.jpg

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Recording output: fallback video material for the talk, not platform code.
# The scripts that produce it are committed; the captures are not.
recording/*.cast
recording/*.gif
recording/antidemo/

# The platform agent: its local decision log
agent/.decisions.jsonl
